blueprint:
  name: "Frank Energie - Smart Battery Manager v3.10"
  description: >
    Slimme batterij-automation voor Frank Energie kwartierprijzen (compatibel met de
    `ha-frank-quarter-prices` integratie) en Solis-omvormers (via `solis_modbus`).

    **v3.10 — logica-fix nacht-baseline + opschoning:** "3.65" zette de accu bij het bereiken van de
    nacht-baseline foutief op *Reserve / Backup* (hard op slot). Dat was verkeerd: het hele doel van
    een nacht-baseline is juist dat je 'm 's nachts nog kunt gebruiken (bijvoorbeeld voor de
    warmtepomp), niet dat hij onbruikbaar wordt. Dit is nu gecorrigeerd naar *Self-Use* — exact
    hetzelfde patroon als Smart Hold en Solar Bypass al gebruikten. Omdat "Reserve / Backup" hiermee
    nergens in de blueprint meer daadwerkelijk gebruikt wordt, is die hele modus-optie (`mode_reserve_text`)
    verwijderd, samen met de overbodig geworden `reserve_like_active`-variabele (die was identiek
    geworden aan de al bestaande `is_force_charging`).

    **v3.9 — discharge-venster wordt actief gewist** in alle niet-verkoop-strategieën (bypast bewust de
    dwell-time-guard, want geen relais-actie).

    **v3.8 — TOU-venster alleen oprekken bij daadwerkelijk actieve Feed-in+TOU, en terugleverprijs in
    verkoop-gerelateerde meldingen.**

    **v3.7 — hardware-bescherming (minimale wisseltijd werkmodus, standaard 30 min) en uniforme
    meldingen.**

    **v3.6 — écht meer dan huisverbruik verkopen** via optioneel "Feed-in Priority + TOU" met een
    rollend Solis-ontlaadvenster.

    **v3.5 — batterij absorbeert overschot bij negatieve terugleverprijs.**

    **v3.4 — status-log en notificatie-controle** via `input_text`/`input_boolean`-helpers.

    **v3.3 — standaardwaarden ingevuld voor Fripistack's installatie.**

    **v3.2 — duidelijkere instellingen** ("Buffer Discount" en "Min. Discharge Profit").

    **v3.1 — instellingen aanpasbaar via dashboard** met `input_number`-helpers.

    **v3.0 — architectuurwijziging:** één `select.pv_omvormer_work_mode`-entiteit i.p.v. losse
    schakelaars. Self-Use is overal de standaard buiten momenten van bewust geforceerd laden/verkopen.

    **Strategieën (in volgorde van prioriteit) en de modus die ze aanzetten:**
    1. **Boost Mode** — handmatig, forceert *Self-Use + TOU* en Target SoC 100%.
    2. **Emergency Charge** — *Self-Use + TOU* zodra SoC onder de veiligheidsbodem dreigt te zakken.
    3. **Negatieve Terugleverprijs** — *Self-Use* zolang de accu nog ruimte heeft.
    4. **Zone-modus** [optioneel] — *Self-Use (+TOU)* om te laden, *Feed-in Priority (+TOU)* om te
       verkopen tot de nacht-baseline, dan weer *Self-Use* (huisverbruik, bv. warmtepomp, blijft
       gedekt).
    5. **Smart Charging/Discharging/Solar Bypass/Smart Hold** — prijsdrempel-fallback wanneer
       Zone-modus niet actief is.

    Alle sensoren en instellingen staan gegroepeerd in secties hieronder. De meeste secties zijn
    optioneel — laat ze leeg om de bijbehorende functionaliteit uit te schakelen.
  domain: automation
  input:
    basis_omvormer:
      name: "Basis: Batterij & Omvormer"
      icon: mdi:home-battery
      collapsed: false
      input:
        work_mode_select:
          name: "Select: Solis Work Mode"
          description: >-
            select.pv_omvormer_work_mode (of vergelijkbaar) - de ene entiteit die alle laad/ontlaad-
            gedrag bepaalt. Vervangt de vroegere losse Reserve/Time-Of-Use/Feed-in-switches.
          default: "select.pv_omvormer_work_mode"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: select
        mode_min_dwell_minutes:
          name: "Minimale Wisseltijd Werkmodus (minuten)"
          description: >-
            Hardware-bescherming: nadat de werkmodus is gewisseld, wordt deze minimaal dit aantal
            minuten aangehouden voordat er weer geschakeld mag worden (voorkomt snel heen-en-weer
            klikken van het relais, bv. wanneer een zone-einde precies samenvalt met een prijswissel).
            Geldt NIET voor Boost Mode en Emergency Charge — die grijpen altijd direct in.
          default: 30
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0
              max: 120
              unit_of_measurement: "min"
        mode_self_use_text:
          name: "Optie-naam: Self-Use"
          description: "Exacte tekst van deze optie zoals die in jouw select.pv_omvormer_work_mode staat."
          default: "Self-Use"
          selector:
            text:
        mode_self_use_tou_text:
          name: "Optie-naam: Self-Use + TOU"
          description: "Gebruikt zodra geforceerd netladen nodig is (Boost, Emergency, Zone/Smart Charging)."
          default: "Self-Use + TOU"
          selector:
            text:
        mode_feed_in_text:
          name: "Optie-naam: Feed-in Priority"
          default: "Feed-in Priority"
          selector:
            text:
        mode_feed_in_tou_text:
          name: "Optie-naam: Feed-in Priority + TOU"
          description: >-
            Nodig om de accu daadwerkelijk MEER dan het huisverbruik te laten verkopen. "Feed-in
            Priority" alleen dekt bij Solis vaak alleen het huisverbruik/PV-overschot; deze + TOU-variant
            forceert echt extra ontladen naar het net, mits het tijdvenster hieronder actief is.
          default: "Feed-in Priority + TOU"
          selector:
            text:
        battery_soc_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Battery SoC"
          default: "sensor.pv_omvormer_battery_soc"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
              device_class: battery
        target_soc_number:
          name: "Entity: Target SoC"
          default: "number.pv_omvormer_force_charge_soc"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: number
    frank_sensoren:
      name: "Frank Energie: Prijssensoren"
      icon: mdi:currency-eur
      collapsed: false
      input:
        frank_price_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Frank Energy Huidige Prijs (EUR/kWh)"
          description: >-
            Gebruik sensor.frank_current_price van de 'Frank Quarter Prices' integratie. NIET
            sensor.frank_prices_today gebruiken: die geeft het AANTAL prijsblokken terug (bv. 96), geen prijs.
          default: "sensor.frank_current_price"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        frank_prices_today_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Frank Prijzen Vandaag (met 'prices' attribuut)"
          description: "sensor.frank_prices_today - bevat de volledige kwartierreeks van vandaag in het 'prices'-attribuut."
          default: "sensor.frank_prices_today"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        frank_prices_tomorrow_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Frank Prijzen Morgen (met 'prices' attribuut) [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            sensor.frank_prices_tomorrow - is 's ochtends en vroeg in de middag 'unavailable' totdat Frank de
            prijzen publiceert (meestal tussen 13:00-14:00). Dat is normaal en de automation vangt dit op.
          default: "sensor.frank_prices_tomorrow"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        frank_return_price_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Frank Energy Terugleverprijs [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            sensor.frank_current_return_price - de kale marktprijs (zonder belasting) wordt gelezen uit het
            'market_price'-attribuut van deze sensor. Wordt gebruikt om negatieve marktprijzen te detecteren
            (Offgrid/Backflow-blok).
          default: "sensor.frank_current_return_price"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        last_price_helper:
          name: "Helper: Last Purchase Price"
          default: "input_number.laatste_laadprijs"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number
    zone_modus:
      name: "Frank Energie: Zone-modus [OPTIONEEL]"
      icon: mdi:timeline-clock
      collapsed: true
      input:
        frank_cheap_period_sensor:
          name: "Binary Sensor: Frank Cheap Period (Zone-modus) [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            binary_sensor.frank_cheap_period - staat 'on' zolang we nu in de goedkope prijszone van vandaag zitten.
            Laat leeg om Zone-modus uit te schakelen.
          default: "binary_sensor.frank_cheap_period"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: binary_sensor
        frank_expensive_period_sensor:
          name: "Binary Sensor: Frank Expensive Period (Zone-modus) [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            binary_sensor.frank_expensive_period - staat 'on' zolang we nu in de dure prijszone van vandaag zitten.
            Laat leeg om Zone-modus uit te schakelen.
          default: "binary_sensor.frank_expensive_period"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: binary_sensor
        frank_cheap_zone_end_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Frank Cheap Zone Einde [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            sensor.frank_cheap_zone_end_today - tijdstip waarop de goedkope zone vandaag eindigt. Nodig om te
            berekenen wanneer geforceerd netladen ten laatste moet starten. Laat leeg om altijd meteen bij het
            begin van de zone vol vermogen te laden.
          default: "sensor.frank_cheap_zone_end_today"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor

    solis_discharge_tou:
      name: "Solis: Geforceerd Verkopen (TOU-tijdvenster) [OPTIONEEL]"
      icon: mdi:transmission-tower-export
      collapsed: true
      input:
        discharge_slot_start_entity:
          name: "Time: Discharge Slot 1 Start [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            time.pv_omvormer_time_charging_discharge_start_slot_1. Bij Solis werkt "Feed-in Priority"
            vaak alleen tot maximaal het huisverbruik — om de accu écht méér dan dat te laten verkopen
            is een actief TOU-ontlaadvenster nodig. De automation schuift dit venster elke cyclus
            (~5 min) op naar 'nu tot over 10 minuten' zolang er verkocht moet worden. Laat beide
            slot-velden leeg als je dit niet nodig hebt (dan wordt alleen "Feed-in Priority" gebruikt,
            zonder TOU — verkoopt dan mogelijk niet boven je huisverbruik uit).
          default: "time.pv_omvormer_time_charging_discharge_start_slot_1"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: time
        discharge_slot_end_entity:
          name: "Time: Discharge Slot 1 Einde [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: "time.pv_omvormer_time_charging_discharge_end_slot_1"
          default: "time.pv_omvormer_time_charging_discharge_end_slot_1"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: time

    zon_belasting:
      name: "Zon- & Belastingprofiel"
      icon: mdi:weather-sunny
      collapsed: false
      input:
        sun_entity:
          name: "Sensor: Sun"
          default: "sun.sun"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sun
        solar_forecast_today:
          name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Today"
          default: "sensor.energy_production_today"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        solar_forecast_tomorrow:
          name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Tomorrow"
          default: "sensor.energy_production_tomorrow"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        solar_forecast_remaining_today:
          name: "Sensor: Solar Forecast Remaining Today (kWh) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: "sensor.energy_production_today_remaining"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
        p1_power_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: P1 Grid Import (Watt) [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            Een sensor die aangeeft hoeveel vermogen je NU van het net afneemt (positief = je haalt
            stroom van het net; bij teruglevering mag dit 0 of negatief zijn). Dit wordt alleen gebruikt
            om de inkoopprijs-boekhouding nauwkeuriger te maken: als tijdens het laden een deel van het
            vermogen van eigen zon komt en een deel van het net, wordt alleen het net-deel meegeteld
            tegen de huidige prijs.

            Waar vind je 'm? Zoek in Ontwikkelaarshulpmiddelen → Statussen op 'p1', 'grid' of 'vermogen'.
            Veelvoorkomende bronnen: een aparte P1-uitleesmodule (bv. HomeWizard P1 Meter, Slimmelezer,
            DSMR-integratie) geeft meestal iets als sensor.p1_meter_active_power_w of
            sensor.slimme_meter_huidig_verbruik. Heb je zo'n aparte P1-uitlezer niet, dan kun je als
            benadering ook de eigen netmeting van je omvormer gebruiken (bv.
            sensor.pv_omvormer_ac_grid_port_power) — check dan wel of positief bij jou ook echt
            'importeren van het net' betekent en niet andersom.

            Volledig optioneel: laat dit leeg en de automation rekent dan simpelweg de volle huidige
            prijs als inkoopprijs zodra er geforceerd wordt geladen — iets minder precies bij gedeeltelijk
            zon-laden, maar werkt prima.
          default: "sensor.kwh_meter_vermogen"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
              device_class: power
        battery_power_sensor:
          name: "Sensor: Battery Charging Power (Watt) [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            Het huidige laad/ontlaadvermogen van de accu zelf (bv. sensor.pv_omvormer_battery_power, of
            als je losse laad/ontlaad-sensoren hebt zoals eerder besproken: gebruik dan de laad-sensor).
            Wordt samen met de P1-sensor hierboven gebruikt om te bepalen welk deel van het laden uit
            het net kwam. Ook optioneel — zelfde fallback-gedrag als hierboven als je 'm leeg laat.
          default: "sensor.pv_omvormer_battery_charge_power"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: sensor
              device_class: power

        sensor_load_night:
          name: "Sensor: Night Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
        fallback_load_night:
          name: "Fallback: Night Load (00:00 - 06:00) in kW"
          default: 0.3
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0.0
              max: 10.0
              step: 0.1

        sensor_load_morning:
          name: "Sensor: Morning Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
        fallback_load_morning:
          name: "Fallback: Morning Load (06:00 - 09:00) in kW"
          default: 1.5
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0.0
              max: 10.0
              step: 0.1

        sensor_load_day:
          name: "Sensor: Day Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
        fallback_load_day:
          name: "Fallback: Day Load (09:00 - 17:00) in kW"
          default: 0.5
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0.0
              max: 10.0
              step: 0.1

        sensor_load_evening:
          name: "Sensor: Evening Load (kW) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: ["sensor", "input_number"]
        fallback_load_evening:
          name: "Fallback: Evening Load (17:00 - 00:00) in kW"
          default: 2.0
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0.0
              max: 10.0
              step: 0.1

    strategie:
      name: "Strategie-parameters"
      icon: mdi:tune
      collapsed: false
      input:
        battery_capacity_kwh:
          name: "Battery Capacity (kWh)"
          default: 16
          selector:
            number:
              min: 1
              max: 100
              step: 0.1
        charge_power_kw:
          name: "Charge Speed (kW)"
          default: 3.6
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0.1
              max: 22
              step: 0.1
        safety_factor:
          name: "BMS Safety Factor"
          default: 1.5
          selector:
            number:
              min: 1.0
              max: 4.0
              step: 0.1
        max_price_cap_helper:
          name: "Helper: Absolute Max Price (EUR)"
          description: >-
            input_number-helper (bv. min 0, max 2.0, step 0.01, default 0.35). Zo kun je dit dashboard-
            aanpasbaar maken; zie de dashboard-uitleg voor hoe je zo'n helper aanmaakt.
          default: "input_number.max_price_cap"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number

        profit_lock_step:
          name: "Smart Hold: Profit Lock Step (%)"
          default: 5
          selector:
            number:
              min: 1
              max: 20
              unit_of_measurement: "%"
        morning_survival_soc_helper:
          name: "Helper: Morning Survival Target (%)"
          description: "input_number-helper (bv. min 10, max 80, step 1, default 35)."
          default: "input_number.morning_survival_target"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number
        peak_hours_count:
          name: "Peak Analysis Window"
          default: 3
          selector:
            number:
              min: 1
              max: 6
        buffer_discount_percentage_helper:
          name: "Helper: Opportunistische Laaddrempel (% onder piekprijs)"
          description: >-
            input_number-helper (bv. min 10, max 90, step 1, default 40). Naast het strikte 'ik heb dit
            echt nodig'-laadmoment mag de accu OOK laden zodra de prijs minstens dit percentage lager
            ligt dan de gemiddelde piekprijs van de komende uren. Bij 40%: als de piekprijs €0,50 is,
            mag er al geladen worden zodra de prijs onder €0,30 zakt, ook al is dat niet strikt
            noodzakelijk om je doel-SoC te halen. Hoger percentage = terughoudender (alleen bij een
            grote dip); lager percentage = de accu pakt sneller elke relatief goedkope prijs mee.
          default: "input_number.buffer_discount_percentage"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number
        min_discharge_margin_helper:
          name: "Helper: Minimale Verkoopmarge boven Inkoopprijs (%)"
          description: >-
            input_number-helper (bv. min 0, max 100, step 1, default 20). De accu begint pas te
            verkopen/ontladen zodra de huidige prijs minstens dit percentage HOGER ligt dan wat je
            gemiddeld voor die stroom hebt betaald. Bij 20%: heb je gemiddeld €0,20/kWh betaald, dan
            verkoopt de accu pas vanaf €0,24/kWh. Hoger percentage = wachten op een grotere winstmarge
            voor je verkoopt; lager percentage = sneller (met minder marge) verkopen.
          default: "input_number.min_discharge_margin"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number

        min_base_soc_helper:
          name: "Helper: Absolute Minimum SoC (%)"
          description: "input_number-helper (bv. min 0, max 100, step 1, default 15)."
          default: "input_number.min_base_soc"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number

        target_soc_winter_helper:
          name: "Helper: Target SoC (Winter)"
          description: "input_number-helper (bv. min 10, max 100, step 1, default 90)."
          default: "input_number.target_soc_winter"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number
        target_soc_summer_helper:
          name: "Helper: Target SoC (Summer)"
          description: "input_number-helper (bv. min 10, max 100, step 1, default 30)."
          default: "input_number.target_soc_summer"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_number
        summer_solar_threshold:
          name: "Summer Solar Threshold (kWh)"
          default: 8
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0
              max: 100

    net_backflow:
      name: "Net & Terug levering [OPTIONEEL]"
      icon: mdi:transmission-tower
      collapsed: true
      input:
        offgrid_switch:
          name: "Switch: Offgrid Mode [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: switch
        backflow_power_entity:
          name: "Entity: Backflow Power Limit (Watt) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: []
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: number
        normal_backflow_limit:
          name: "Normal Backflow Limit (Watt)"
          default: 5000
          selector:
            number:
              min: 0
              max: 20000
              step: 100

    handmatig:
      name: "Handmatige Bediening [OPTIONEEL]"
      icon: mdi:hand-back-right
      collapsed: true
      input:
        boost_switch:
          name: "Switch: Manual Boost"
          default: "input_boolean.battery_boost"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_boolean
        disable_bypass_switch:
          name: "Switch: Disable Solar Bypass (Force Sun Charge) [OPTIONEEL]"
          default: "input_boolean.forceer_zon_laden"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: ["input_boolean", "switch"]
    notificaties_taal:
      name: "Notificaties & Taal"
      icon: mdi:bell-outline
      collapsed: false
      input:
        language:
          name: "Language / Taal"
          default: "nl"
          selector:
            select:
              options:
                - label: "English"
                  value: "en"
                - label: "Nederlands"
                  value: "nl"
        notify_device:
          name: "Notification Device"
          default: "0704c51cc459c03006134a1a21b12e0d"
          selector:
            device:
              integration: mobile_app
        report_time_evening:
          name: "Report Time (Evening)"
          default: "21:30:00"
          selector:
            time:
        report_time_morning:
          name: "Report Time (Morning)"
          default: "08:00:00"
          selector:
            time:
        notify_report_toggle:
          name: "Schakelaar: Dagelijks Rapport aan/uit [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            input_boolean-helper. Staat 'on' (of leeg gelaten) → je krijgt het ochtend/avond-rapport.
            Staat 'off' → geen rapport-meldingen, wel alle andere meldingen gewoon.
          default: "input_boolean.notify_report_toggle"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_boolean
        notify_strategy_toggle:
          name: "Schakelaar: Strategie-meldingen aan/uit [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            input_boolean-helper. Regelt alle "Start Laden/Ontladen", Solar Bypass, Smart Hold en Zone-
            gebeurtenis-meldingen. Staat 'on' (of leeg gelaten) → je krijgt ze. Staat 'off' → stil, op
            Noodladen na (dat blijft altijd gemeld, veiligheidsreden).
          default: "input_boolean.notify_strategy_toggle"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_boolean

    debug_log:
      name: "Debug & Logging [OPTIONEEL]"
      icon: mdi:text-box-search-outline
      collapsed: true
      input:
        status_log_helper:
          name: "Helper: Automation Status [OPTIONEEL]"
          description: >-
            input_text-helper (max lengte gerust op 50 laten). De automation schrijft hier bij elke
            beslissing een kort statuswoord naartoe (bv. 'Laden', 'Wachten', 'Zone-Net', 'Idle'), zodat
            je op het dashboard kunt zien in welke staat hij nu zit. Gecombineerd met een Logbook-kaart
            op het dashboard krijg je er gratis een geschiedenis bij (Home Assistant houdt bij wanneer
            een entity van waarde verandert). Laat leeg om dit uit te schakelen.
          default: "input_text.automation_status_log"
          selector:
            entity:
              domain: input_text

trigger_variables:
  boost_entity: !input boost_switch
  cheap_zone_entity: !input frank_cheap_period_sensor
  expensive_zone_entity: !input frank_expensive_period_sensor

trigger:
  - platform: time_pattern
    minutes: "/5"
    id: "timer"
  - platform: time
    at: !input report_time_evening
    id: "report"
  - platform: time
    at: !input report_time_morning
    id: "report"
  - platform: state
    entity_id: !input frank_price_sensor
    id: "price_change"
  - platform: state
    entity_id: !input battery_soc_sensor
    id: "soc_change"
  - platform: template
    value_template: "{{ boost_entity != [] and is_state(boost_entity, 'on') }}"
    id: "boost"
  - platform: template
    value_template: >-
      {{ (cheap_zone_entity != [] and is_state(cheap_zone_entity, 'on')) ~ '|' ~
         (expensive_zone_entity != [] and is_state(expensive_zone_entity, 'on')) }}
    id: "zone_change"

action:
  - condition: template
    value_template: >-
      {% if trigger is defined and trigger.platform == 'state' %}
        {{ trigger.to_state.state != trigger.from_state.state }}
      {% else %}
        true
      {% endif %}

  - variables:
      language: !input language
      conf_soc_sensor: !input battery_soc_sensor
      conf_price_sensor: !input frank_price_sensor
      conf_prices_today: !input frank_prices_today_sensor
      conf_prices_tomorrow: !input frank_prices_tomorrow_sensor
      conf_cheap_period: !input frank_cheap_period_sensor
      conf_expensive_period: !input frank_expensive_period_sensor
      conf_cheap_zone_end: !input frank_cheap_zone_end_sensor
      conf_last_price: !input last_price_helper
      conf_boost: !input boost_switch
      conf_disable_bypass: !input disable_bypass_switch
      conf_notify: !input notify_device
      conf_notify_report_toggle: !input notify_report_toggle
      conf_notify_strategy_toggle: !input notify_strategy_toggle
      conf_status_log: !input status_log_helper
      conf_target_num: !input target_soc_number
      conf_work_mode: !input work_mode_select
      p_mode_min_dwell: !input mode_min_dwell_minutes
      mode_self_use: !input mode_self_use_text
      mode_self_use_tou: !input mode_self_use_tou_text
      mode_feed_in: !input mode_feed_in_text
      mode_feed_in_tou: !input mode_feed_in_tou_text
      conf_discharge_slot_start: !input discharge_slot_start_entity
      conf_discharge_slot_end: !input discharge_slot_end_entity
      conf_sun: !input sun_entity
      conf_p1: !input p1_power_sensor
      conf_bat_pow: !input battery_power_sensor
      conf_return_price: !input frank_return_price_sensor
      conf_offgrid: !input offgrid_switch
      conf_backflow: !input backflow_power_entity
      p_normal_backflow: !input normal_backflow_limit
      conf_solar_rem: !input solar_forecast_remaining_today
      conf_load_night: !input sensor_load_night
      fallback_night: !input fallback_load_night
      conf_load_morning: !input sensor_load_morning
      fallback_morning: !input fallback_load_morning
      conf_load_day: !input sensor_load_day
      fallback_day: !input fallback_load_day
      conf_load_evening: !input sensor_load_evening
      fallback_evening: !input fallback_load_evening
      p_lock_step: !input profit_lock_step
      conf_morning_soc_helper: !input morning_survival_soc_helper
      p_peak_count: !input peak_hours_count
      conf_buffer_disc_helper: !input buffer_discount_percentage_helper
      conf_min_discharge_helper: !input min_discharge_margin_helper
      p_bat_cap: !input battery_capacity_kwh
      p_charge_kw: !input charge_power_kw
      p_safety: !input safety_factor
      conf_max_price_cap_helper: !input max_price_cap_helper
      conf_min_base_soc_helper: !input min_base_soc_helper
      conf_target_winter_helper: !input target_soc_winter_helper
      conf_target_summer_helper: !input target_soc_summer_helper
      t_solar_th: !input summer_solar_threshold
      s_sol_today: !input solar_forecast_today
      s_sol_tom: !input solar_forecast_tomorrow

  - variables:
      current_soc: "{{ states(conf_soc_sensor) | float(0) }}"
      last_paid_price: "{{ states(conf_last_price) | float(0) }}"
      is_boost_active: "{{ conf_boost != [] and is_state(conf_boost, 'on') }}"
      has_notify_device: "{{ conf_notify != [] }}"
      notify_report_enabled: >-
        {{ has_notify_device and (conf_notify_report_toggle == [] or is_state(conf_notify_report_toggle, 'on')) }}
      notify_strategy_enabled: >-
        {{ has_notify_device and (conf_notify_strategy_toggle == [] or is_state(conf_notify_strategy_toggle, 'on')) }}
      now_ts: "{{ as_timestamp(now()) }}"
      is_daytime: "{{ is_state(conf_sun, 'above_horizon') }}"
      raw_price_state: "{{ states(conf_price_sensor) }}"
      current_work_mode: "{{ states(conf_work_mode) }}"
      is_force_charging: "{{ current_work_mode == mode_self_use_tou }}"
      mode_seconds_since_change: >-
        {{ (as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(states[conf_work_mode].last_changed)) if conf_work_mode else 999999 }}
      mode_dwell_satisfied: >-
        {{ (mode_seconds_since_change | float(999999)) >= ((p_mode_min_dwell | float(30)) * 60) }}
      discharge_slot_start_str: "{{ now().strftime('%H:%M:%S') }}"
      discharge_slot_end_str: "{{ (now() + timedelta(minutes=10)).strftime('%H:%M:%S') }}"
      current_price: >-
        {% if raw_price_state in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ last_paid_price | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ raw_price_state | float(last_paid_price | float(0)) }}
        {% endif %}
      current_raw_price: >-
        {% set mp = state_attr(conf_return_price, 'market_price') if conf_return_price != [] else none %}
        {% if mp is not none %}
          {{ mp | float(0.0) }}
        {% else %}
          0.0
        {% endif %}
      is_zero_export_window: >-
        {% if conf_return_price != [] %}
          {{ (current_raw_price | float(0)) < 0.0 and (current_price | float(0)) >= 0.0 }}
        {% else %}
          False
        {% endif %}
      is_cheap_zone: "{{ conf_cheap_period != [] and is_state(conf_cheap_period, 'on') }}"
      is_expensive_zone: "{{ conf_expensive_period != [] and is_state(conf_expensive_period, 'on') }}"
      is_bypass_disabled: >-
        {% if conf_disable_bypass != [] and is_state(conf_disable_bypass, 'on') and (current_soc | float(0)) < 95 %}
          True
        {% else %}
          False
        {% endif %}
      val_night: >-
        {% if conf_load_night != [] and states(conf_load_night) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_night) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_night | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_morning: >-
        {% if conf_load_morning != [] and states(conf_load_morning) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_morning) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_morning | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_day: >-
        {% if conf_load_day != [] and states(conf_load_day) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_day) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_day | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      val_evening: >-
        {% if conf_load_evening != [] and states(conf_load_evening) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ states(conf_load_evening) | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ fallback_evening | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      current_load_kw: >-
        {% set h = now().hour %}
        {% if h < 6 %} {{ val_night | float(0) }}
        {% elif h < 9 %} {{ val_morning | float(0) }}
        {% elif h < 17 %} {{ val_day | float(0) }}
        {% else %} {{ val_evening | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      p_morning_soc: "{{ states(conf_morning_soc_helper) | float(35) }}"
      p_buffer_disc: "{{ states(conf_buffer_disc_helper) | float(40) }}"
      p_min_discharge: "{{ states(conf_min_discharge_helper) | float(20) }}"
      p_max_cap: "{{ states(conf_max_price_cap_helper) | float(0.35) }}"
      p_min_base_soc: "{{ states(conf_min_base_soc_helper) | float(15) }}"
      t_winter: "{{ states(conf_target_winter_helper) | float(90) }}"
      t_summer: "{{ states(conf_target_summer_helper) | float(30) }}"

  - variables:
      current_charging_cost: >-
        {% if conf_p1 != [] and conf_bat_pow != [] %}
          {% set grid_w = states(conf_p1) | float(0) %}
          {% set bat_w = states(conf_bat_pow) | float(0) %}
          {% if bat_w > 10 %}
            {% set grid_import = [grid_w, 0] | max %}
            {% set ratio = [(grid_import / bat_w), 1.0] | min %}
            {{ (current_price | float(0)) * ratio }}
          {% else %}
            {{ current_price | float(0) if is_force_charging else 0.0 }}
          {% endif %}
        {% else %}
          {{ current_price | float(0) if is_force_charging else 0.0 }}
        {% endif %}

  - choose:
      - conditions:
          - condition: trigger
            id: "soc_change"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ trigger.to_state.state | float(0) > trigger.from_state.state | float(0) }}"
        sequence:
          - service: input_number.set_value
            target: {entity_id: !input last_price_helper}
            data:
              value: >-
                {% set old_soc = trigger.from_state.state | float(0) %}
                {% set new_soc = trigger.to_state.state | float(0) %}
                {% set diff = new_soc - old_soc %}
                {% set old_price = last_paid_price | float(0) %}
                {% set cost = current_charging_cost | float(current_price | float(0)) %}
                {% if not is_daytime and cost == 0 %}
                  {{ old_price }}
                {% else %}
                  {% if new_soc > 0 %}
                    {{ (((old_soc * old_price) + (diff * cost)) / new_soc) | round(4) }}
                  {% else %}
                    {{ old_price }}
                  {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
          - stop: "Prijs succesvol geupdate via SOC stijging."

  - variables:
      raw_today: "{{ state_attr(conf_prices_today, 'prices') }}"
      raw_tomorrow: >-
        {{ state_attr(conf_prices_tomorrow, 'prices') if conf_prices_tomorrow != [] else [] }}
      prices_json: >-
        {% set ns = namespace(items=[]) %}
        {% for item in (raw_today or []) %}
          {% set ts_val = as_timestamp(item.from, 0) %}
          {% if ts_val %}
            {% set ns.items = ns.items + [{
              "local_hour": item.from[11:13] | int(0),
              "day_str": "Vandaag",
              "ts": ts_val,
              "price": item.total_price_eur_kwh | float(0)
            }] %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% for item in (raw_tomorrow or []) %}
          {% set ts_val = as_timestamp(item.from, 0) %}
          {% if ts_val %}
            {% set ns.items = ns.items + [{
              "local_hour": item.from[11:13] | int(0),
              "day_str": "Morgen",
              "ts": ts_val,
              "price": item.total_price_eur_kwh | float(0)
            }] %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {{ ns.items }}

  - variables:
      filtered_data: >-
        {% set output = namespace(all_prices=[], future_slots=[], charge_prices=[], discharge_prices=[]) %}
        {% set history_cutoff = now_ts - 3600 %}
        {% set charge_lookahead = now_ts + (12 * 3600) %}
        {% set discharge_lookahead = now_ts + (8 * 3600) %}
        {% if prices_json %}
          {% for item in prices_json %}
            {% if item.ts >= history_cutoff %}
              {% set output.all_prices = output.all_prices + [item.price] %}
              {% set output.future_slots = output.future_slots + [item] %}
              {% if item.ts <= charge_lookahead %}
                {% set output.charge_prices = output.charge_prices + [item.price] %}
              {% endif %}
              {% if item.ts <= discharge_lookahead %}
                {% set output.discharge_prices = output.discharge_prices + [item.price] %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
        {% set pk_count = p_peak_count | int %}
        {% set sorted_charge = output.charge_prices | sort(reverse=True) %}
        {% set rolling_peak = 0.0 %}
        {% if sorted_charge | length > 0 %}
          {% set count = [sorted_charge|length, pk_count] | min %}
          {% set rolling_peak = (sorted_charge[:count] | sum / count) | float(0) %}
        {% endif %}
        {"all": {{ output.all_prices }}, "slots": {{ output.future_slots }}, "peak": {{ rolling_peak }}, "discharge_term": {{ output.discharge_prices }} }

  - variables:
      sorted_all: "{{ filtered_data.all | sort }}"
      relevant_peak_price: "{{ filtered_data.peak | float(0) }}"
      buffer_limit: "{{ (relevant_peak_price | float(0)) * (1 - ((p_buffer_disc | float(0)) / 100)) }}"
      forecast_tomorrow_val: "{{ states(s_sol_tom) | float(0) }}"
      relevant_solar: >-
        {% if now().hour >= 14 %} {{ forecast_tomorrow_val | float(0) }}
        {% else %} {{ states(s_sol_today) | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}
      dynamic_target_soc: >-
        {% if (relevant_solar | float(0)) > (t_solar_th | float(0)) %} {{ t_summer | float(0) }}
        {% else %} {{ t_winter | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}

      effective_solar_rem: >-
        {% if conf_solar_rem != [] and states(conf_solar_rem) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {% set raw_solar = states(conf_solar_rem) | float(0) %}
          {% set h = now().hour %}
          {% set sunset_hour = 20 %}
          {% set ns = namespace(solar_load=0.0) %}
          {% for i in range(h, sunset_hour) %}
            {% if i < 6 %} {% set ns.solar_load = ns.solar_load + (val_night | float(0)) %}
            {% elif i < 9 %} {% set ns.solar_load = ns.solar_load + (val_morning | float(0)) %}
            {% elif i < 17 %} {% set ns.solar_load = ns.solar_load + (val_day | float(0)) %}
            {% else %} {% set ns.solar_load = ns.solar_load + (val_evening | float(0)) %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          {{ [raw_solar - ns.solar_load, 0.0] | max }}
        {% else %}
          0.0
        {% endif %}

      solar_charging_override: >-
        {% set virtual_soc_solar = current_soc | float(0) %}
        {% if not is_force_charging %}
          {% set virtual_soc_solar = (current_soc | float(0)) + 3.0 %}
        {% endif %}
        {% set deficit = (dynamic_target_soc | float(0)) - virtual_soc_solar %}
        {% if deficit > 0 %}
          {% set kwh_needed = (deficit / 100.0) * (p_bat_cap | float(0)) %}
          {{ (effective_solar_rem | float(0)) >= kwh_needed and (current_price | float(0)) >= 0.0 }}
        {% else %}
          True
        {% endif %}

      zone_charge_deficit_kwh: >-
        {{ (((100 - (current_soc|float(0))) / 100.0) * (p_bat_cap|float(0))) | round(3) }}

      zone_charge_net_kwh_needed: >-
        {{ [ (zone_charge_deficit_kwh|float(0)) - (effective_solar_rem|float(0)), 0.0 ] | max | round(3) }}

      zone_charge_hours_needed: >-
        {% set net = zone_charge_net_kwh_needed | float(0) %}
        {% if net <= 0 %}
          0.0
        {% else %}
          {{ (net / (p_charge_kw | float(3.0)) * (p_safety | float(1.0))) | round(2) }}
        {% endif %}

      zone_cheap_end_ts: >-
        {% if conf_cheap_zone_end != [] and states(conf_cheap_zone_end) not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none'] %}
          {{ as_timestamp(states(conf_cheap_zone_end), 0) }}
        {% else %}
          0
        {% endif %}

      zone_charge_should_start_now: >-
        {% if (zone_cheap_end_ts | float(0)) <= 0 %}
          true
        {% else %}
          {{ (now_ts + ((zone_charge_hours_needed|float(0)) * 3600)) >= (zone_cheap_end_ts|float(0)) }}
        {% endif %}

      zone_discharge_sellable_kwh: >-
        {{ ([ ((current_soc|float(0)) - (p_morning_soc|float(0))) / 100.0 * (p_bat_cap|float(0)), 0.0 ] | max) | round(3) }}

      zone_discharge_floor_reached: >-
        {{ (current_soc | float(0)) <= ((p_morning_soc | float(0)) + 1) }}

      morning_survival_limit: >-
        {% set current_h = now().hour %}
        {% if current_h < 6 or current_h >= 21 %}
          {% set survival_target = p_morning_soc | float(0) %}
          {% set is_active_morning = is_force_charging and (states(conf_target_num)|float(0) == survival_target) %}
          {% set threshold = survival_target if is_active_morning else (survival_target - 2) %}
          {% if (current_soc | float(0)) < threshold %}
            {% set deficit = survival_target - (current_soc | float(0)) %}
            {% set kwh_needed = (deficit / 100.0) * (p_bat_cap | float(0)) %}
            {% set hours_needed = (kwh_needed / (p_charge_kw | float(3.0)) * (p_safety | float(1.0))) | round(0, 'ceil') | int %}
            {% set hours_needed = [hours_needed, 1] | max %}
            {% set today_date = now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d') %}
            {% set today_6am = as_timestamp(today_date ~ ' 06:00:00') %}
            {% set target_6am = (today_6am + 86400) if current_h >= 6 else today_6am %}
            {% set ns = namespace(prices=[]) %}
            {% for item in filtered_data.slots %}
              {% if item.ts < target_6am %}
                {% set ns.prices = ns.prices + [item.price | float(0)] %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% set sorted_night = ns.prices | sort %}
            {% if sorted_night | length > 0 %}
              {% set idx = (hours_needed - 1) if (hours_needed - 1) < sorted_night|length else (sorted_night|length - 1) %}
              {{ sorted_night[idx] }}
            {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}
          {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}
        {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}

      charge_limit_strict: >-
        {% set deficit = (dynamic_target_soc | float(0)) - (current_soc | float(0)) %}
        {% if deficit > 0 %}
          {% set kwh_needed = (deficit / 100.0) * (p_bat_cap | float(0)) %}
          {% set net_kwh_needed = kwh_needed - (effective_solar_rem | float(0)) %}
          {% if net_kwh_needed > 0 %}
            {% set hours_needed = (net_kwh_needed / (p_charge_kw | float(3.0)) * (p_safety | float(1.0))) | round(0, 'ceil') | int %}
            {% set hours_needed = [hours_needed, 1] | max %}
            {% if sorted_all | length > 0 %}
              {% set idx = (hours_needed - 1) if (hours_needed - 1) < sorted_all|length else (sorted_all|length - 1) %}
              {{ sorted_all[idx] }}
            {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}
          {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}
        {% else %} -999.0 {% endif %}

      active_target_soc: >-
        {% set is_morning_charge = (morning_survival_limit | float(-999.0)) != -999.0 and ((current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (morning_survival_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3)) and ((current_soc | float(0.0)) < ((p_morning_soc | float(0.0)) - 0.1)) %}
        {% set normal_strict = (charge_limit_strict | float(-999.0)) != -999.0 and ((current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (charge_limit_strict | float(0.0)) | round(3)) and not solar_charging_override %}
        {% set normal_buffer = ((current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (buffer_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3)) and not solar_charging_override %}
        {% if normal_strict or normal_buffer %}
          {{ dynamic_target_soc | float(0) }}
        {% elif is_morning_charge %}
          {{ p_morning_soc | float(0) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ dynamic_target_soc | float(0) }}
        {% endif %}

      discharge_start_price: >-
        {% set base_margin_price = (last_paid_price | float(0)) * (1 + ((p_min_discharge|float(0)) / 100)) %}
        {% set virtual_soc = current_soc | float(0) %}
        {% if not is_force_charging and (current_soc | float(0)) > ((p_min_base_soc | float(0)) + 1) %}
          {% set virtual_soc = (current_soc | float(0)) + 2.0 %}
        {% endif %}
        {% set usable_soc = virtual_soc - (p_min_base_soc | float(0)) %}
        {% if usable_soc > 0 %}
          {% set ns = namespace(hours_to_charge=8) %}
          {% set limit_strict = charge_limit_strict | float(0) %}
          {% set limit_buffer = buffer_limit | float(0) %}
          {% for item in filtered_data.slots[:8] %}
            {% if (item.price | float(0)) <= limit_strict or (item.price | float(0)) <= limit_buffer %}
              {% if loop.index0 < ns.hours_to_charge %}
                {% set ns.hours_to_charge = loop.index0 %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          {% set horizon = [ns.hours_to_charge, 1] | max %}
          {% set kwh_avail = (usable_soc / 100.0) * (p_bat_cap | float(0)) %}
          {% set h = now().hour %}
          {% set ns2 = namespace(rem=kwh_avail, hours=0) %}
          {% for i in range(h, h + 24) %}
            {% if ns2.rem > 0 %}
              {% set hd = i % 24 %}
              {% set load = (val_night | float(0)) if hd < 6 else ((val_morning | float(0)) if hd < 9 else ((val_day | float(0)) if hd < 17 else (val_evening | float(0)))) %}
              {% set ns2.rem = ns2.rem - load %}
              {% set ns2.hours = ns2.hours + 1 %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          {% set hours_to_empty = [ns2.hours, 1] | max %}
          {% set active_slots = filtered_data.slots[:horizon] | map(attribute='price') | list %}
          {% set reverse_sorted = active_slots | sort(reverse=True) %}
          {% set lookahead_len = reverse_sorted | length %}
          {% if lookahead_len > 0 %}
            {% set allowed_hours = [hours_to_empty, lookahead_len] | min %}
            {% set optimal_price = reverse_sorted[allowed_hours - 1] | float(0) %}
            {% set raw_discharge = [base_margin_price, optimal_price] | max %}
          {% else %}
            {% set raw_discharge = base_margin_price %}
          {% endif %}
        {% else %}
          {% set raw_discharge = base_margin_price %}
        {% endif %}
        {% set active_charge_limit = [charge_limit_strict | float(-999.0), morning_survival_limit | float(-999.0)] | max %}
        {% if active_charge_limit != -999.0 %}
          {{ [raw_discharge, (active_charge_limit + 0.01)] | max | round(4) }}
        {% else %}
          {{ raw_discharge | round(4) }}
        {% endif %}

      feed_in_start_price: >-
        {% set peak_bypass = (relevant_peak_price | float(0)) * 0.85 %}
        {% set discharge_bypass = (discharge_start_price | float(0)) * 0.85 %}
        {{ [peak_bypass, discharge_bypass] | max | round(3) }}

  - if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: "{{ conf_disable_bypass != [] and is_state(conf_disable_bypass, 'on') and (current_soc | float(0)) >= 95 }}"
    then:
      - service: homeassistant.turn_off
        target: {entity_id: !input disable_bypass_switch}
      - if:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
        then:
          - domain: mobile_app
            type: notify
            device_id: !input notify_device
            title: "Bypass-blokkade uit"
            message: "95% SoC bereikt, bypass-blokkade automatisch uitgeschakeld · SoC {{ current_soc }}%"

  - choose:
      - alias: "1. Send Report"
        conditions:
          - condition: trigger
            id: "report"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ notify_report_enabled }}"
            then:
              - domain: mobile_app
                type: notify
                device_id: !input notify_device
                title: "Dagrapport"
                message: >-
                  {% if language == 'nl' %}
                    SoC {{ current_soc }}% · Inkoop EUR{{ last_paid_price | float(0) | round(3) }} · Huidig EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}{% if conf_return_price != [] %} · Terugleverprijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) }}{% endif %}
                    Modus: {{ current_work_mode }}
                    Drempels:
                    Strikt: EUR{{ charge_limit_strict | float(0) | round(3) }}
                    Morning: EUR{{ morning_survival_limit | float(0) | round(3) }}
                    Feed-In Bypass: EUR{{ feed_in_start_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                    Verkoopgrens: EUR{{ discharge_start_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                    Netto zon resterend: {{ effective_solar_rem | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh
                    (Profiel: {{ current_load_kw | float(0) }} kW afname nu)
                    {% if conf_cheap_period != [] or conf_expensive_period != [] %}
                    Zone-modus: {{ 'CHEAP ZONE actief' if is_cheap_zone else ('EXPENSIVE ZONE actief' if is_expensive_zone else 'buiten zone (Smart actief)') }}
                    {% if is_cheap_zone %}
                    Nog benodigd tot vol: {{ zone_charge_hours_needed }}u netladen ({{ zone_charge_net_kwh_needed }} kWh)
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if is_expensive_zone %}
                    Nog te verkopen tot nacht-baseline ({{ p_morning_soc }}%): {{ zone_discharge_sellable_kwh }} kWh
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endif %}
                  {% else %}
                    Status: {{ current_soc }}% | Mode: {{ current_work_mode }}
                    Net solar remaining: {{ effective_solar_rem | float(0) | round(2) }} kWh
                  {% endif %}

      - alias: "2. Boost Mode"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ is_boost_active }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Boost"}
          - service: number.set_value
            target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
            data: {value: 100}
          - &clear_discharge_slot
            if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_start_entity}
                data: {time: "00:00:00"}
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_end_entity}
                data: {time: "00:00:00"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use_tou }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use_tou }}"}

      - alias: "3. Emergency Charge"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: >-
              {% set target = states(conf_target_num)|float(0) %}
              {% set is_active_emerg = is_force_charging and (target == ((p_min_base_soc | float(0)) + 2)) %}
              {% set threshold = ((p_min_base_soc | float(0)) + 2) if is_active_emerg else (p_min_base_soc | float(0)) %}
              {{ (current_soc | float(0)) < threshold }}
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0)) < ((p_max_cap | float(0)) * 1.5) }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Noodladen"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (states(conf_target_num)|float(0) - ((p_min_base_soc|float(0)) + 2))|abs > 0.1 }}"
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
                data: {value: "{{ (p_min_base_soc | float(0)) + 2 }}"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use_tou }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use_tou }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ has_notify_device }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Noodladen"
                    message: "Noodladen gestart (SoC onder veiligheidsbodem) · Prijs EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}"

      - alias: "3.3 Negatieve Terugleverprijs (Batterij Absorbeert Overschot)"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ conf_return_price != [] }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_raw_price | float(0)) < 0.0 }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0)) < 99 }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Neg-Export"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (states(conf_target_num)|float(0) - 100)|abs > 0.1 }}"
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
                data: {value: 100}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Neg-Export"
                    message: >-
                      {% if language == 'nl' %}
                        Terugleverprijs negatief, batterij vangt zonoverschot op (Self-Use) · Prijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                      {% else %}
                        Feed-in price negative, battery absorbs solar surplus (Self-Use) · Price EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                      {% endif %}

      - alias: "3.5 Zone Charging (Cheap Period)"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ is_cheap_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_zero_export_window }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "{{ 'Zone-Net' if zone_charge_should_start_now else 'Zone-PV' }}"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - variables:
              desired_mode: "{{ mode_self_use_tou if zone_charge_should_start_now else mode_self_use }}"
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (states(conf_target_num)|float(0) - 100)|abs > 0.1 }}"
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
                data: {value: 100}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != desired_mode  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ desired_mode }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: >-
                      {{ 'Zone-Net' if desired_mode == mode_self_use_tou else 'Zone-PV' }}
                    message: >-
                      {% if desired_mode == mode_self_use_tou %}
                        {% if language == 'nl' %}
                          Vol vermogen laden gestart (laatst mogelijke moment) · Prijs EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                        {% else %}
                          Full power charging started (last possible moment) · Price EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
                        {% endif %}
                      {% else %}
                        {% if language == 'nl' %}
                          Cheap Zone gestart, laadt bij op zon (doel SoC 100%) · nog {{ zone_charge_hours_needed }}u netladen verwacht
                        {% else %}
                          Cheap zone started, topping up on solar (target SoC 100%) · est. {{ zone_charge_hours_needed }}h grid charging needed
                        {% endif %}
                      {% endif %}

      - alias: "3.6 Zone Discharging (Expensive Period)"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not zone_discharge_floor_reached }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Zone-Verkoop"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: >-
                  {{ conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []
                     and (current_work_mode == mode_feed_in_tou or mode_dwell_satisfied) }}
            then:
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_start_entity}
                data: {time: "{{ discharge_slot_start_str }}"}
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_end_entity}
                data: {time: "{{ discharge_slot_end_str }}"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: >-
                  {% set target_mode = mode_feed_in_tou if (conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []) else mode_feed_in %}
                  {{ current_work_mode != target_mode  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data:
                  option: >-
                    {{ mode_feed_in_tou if (conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []) else mode_feed_in }}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Zone-Verkoop"
                    message: >-
                      {% if language == 'nl' %}
                        Expensive Zone actief, verkoopt nu ({{ 'Feed-In Priority + TOU' if (conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []) else 'Feed-In Priority' }}) · Terugleverprijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) if conf_return_price != [] else current_price | float(0) | round(3) }} · nog {{ zone_discharge_sellable_kwh }} kWh tot nacht-baseline ({{ p_morning_soc }}%)
                      {% else %}
                        Expensive zone active, selling now · Feed-in price EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) if conf_return_price != [] else current_price | float(0) | round(3) }} · {{ zone_discharge_sellable_kwh }} kWh left before overnight baseline ({{ p_morning_soc }}%)
                      {% endif %}

      - alias: "3.65 Nacht-baseline Bereikt (Self-Use)"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ zone_discharge_floor_reached }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Zone-Baseline"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Zone-Baseline"
                    message: >-
                      {% if language == 'nl' %}
                        Nacht-baseline bereikt, verkopen gestopt · Self-Use dekt huisverbruik (bv. warmtepomp) verder deze nacht · SoC {{ current_soc }}%
                      {% else %}
                        Overnight baseline reached, selling stopped · Self-Use covers house load (e.g. heat pump) for the rest of the night · SoC {{ current_soc }}%
                      {% endif %}
          - &lock_soc_to_current
            if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: >-
                  {% set target = states(conf_target_num)|float(0) %}
                  {{ (target - (current_soc|float(0))) > 2 or ((current_soc|float(0)) - target) >= (p_lock_step|float(0)) }}
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
                data: {value: "{{ current_soc | int }}"}

      - alias: "4. Smart Charging"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_cheap_zone and not is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_zero_export_window }}"
          - condition: or
            conditions:
              - condition: and
                conditions:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (morning_survival_limit | float(-999.0)) != -999.0 }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (morning_survival_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0.0)) < ((p_morning_soc | float(0.0)) - 0.1) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) < (p_max_cap | float(0.0)) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
              - condition: and
                conditions:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (charge_limit_strict | float(-999.0)) != -999.0 }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (charge_limit_strict | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0.0)) < ((dynamic_target_soc | float(0.0)) - 1) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) < (p_max_cap | float(0.0)) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ not solar_charging_override }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
              - condition: and
                conditions:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) <= (buffer_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0.0)) < ((dynamic_target_soc | float(0.0)) - 1) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) < (p_max_cap | float(0.0)) }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ not solar_charging_override }}"
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Laden"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (states(conf_target_num)|float(0) - (active_target_soc|float(0)))|abs > 0.1 }}"
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input target_soc_number}
                data: {value: "{{ active_target_soc | float(0) }}"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use_tou  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use_tou }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Laden"
                    message: "Start laden · Prijs EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}"

      - alias: "5. Discharging"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_cheap_zone and not is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0)) > ((p_min_base_soc | float(0)) + 1) }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: >-
              {% if not is_force_charging %}
                {{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) >= ((discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) - 0.02) | round(3) }}
              {% else %}
                {{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) >= (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}
              {% endif %}
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) > (buffer_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Ontladen"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: >-
                  {{ conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []
                     and (current_work_mode == mode_feed_in_tou or mode_dwell_satisfied) }}
            then:
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_start_entity}
                data: {time: "{{ discharge_slot_start_str }}"}
              - service: time.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input discharge_slot_end_entity}
                data: {time: "{{ discharge_slot_end_str }}"}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: >-
                  {% set target_mode = mode_feed_in_tou if (conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []) else mode_feed_in %}
                  {{ current_work_mode != target_mode  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data:
                  option: >-
                    {{ mode_feed_in_tou if (conf_discharge_slot_start != [] and conf_discharge_slot_end != []) else mode_feed_in }}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Ontladen"
                    message: >-
                      Start ontladen · Terugleverprijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) if conf_return_price != [] else current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}

      - alias: "5.5. Solar Bypass (Feed-In Priority)"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_cheap_zone and not is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_bypass_disabled }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ is_daytime }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) >= (feed_in_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Bypass"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_feed_in  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_feed_in }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Bypass"
                    message: >-
                      Zon gaat direct naar het net (Feed-In Priority) · Terugleverprijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) if conf_return_price != [] else current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}
          - *lock_soc_to_current

      - alias: "6. Smart Hold"
        conditions:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_cheap_zone and not is_expensive_zone }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_bypass_disabled }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ not is_zero_export_window }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) > (charge_limit_strict | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) > (morning_survival_limit | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}"
          - condition: template
            value_template: >-
              {% if not is_force_charging %}
                {{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < ((discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) - 0.02) | round(3) }}
              {% else %}
                {{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (discharge_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}
              {% endif %}
          - condition: template
            value_template: >-
              {% if is_daytime %}
                {{ (current_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) < (feed_in_start_price | float(0.0)) | round(3) }}
              {% else %}
                true
              {% endif %}
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ (current_soc | float(0.0)) > (p_min_base_soc | float(0.0)) }}"
        sequence:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
            then:
              - service: input_text.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
                data: {value: "Wachten"}
          - *clear_discharge_slot
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
            then:
              - service: select.select_option
                target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
                data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Wachten"
                    message: "Wacht op betere prijs (Self-Use dekt huisverbruik) · Prijs EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}"
          - *lock_soc_to_current

    default:
      - if:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ conf_status_log != [] }}"
        then:
          - service: input_text.set_value
            target: {entity_id: !input status_log_helper}
            data: {value: "Idle"}
      - *clear_discharge_slot
      - if:
          - condition: template
            value_template: "{{ current_work_mode != mode_self_use  and mode_dwell_satisfied }}"
        then:
          - service: select.select_option
            target: {entity_id: !input work_mode_select}
            data: {option: "{{ mode_self_use }}"}

  - if:
      - condition: template
        value_template: "{{ conf_return_price != [] }}"
    then:
      - choose:
          - conditions:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) < 0.0 }}"
            sequence:
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ conf_offgrid != [] and is_state(conf_offgrid, 'off') }}"
                then:
                  - service: switch.turn_on
                    target: {entity_id: !input offgrid_switch}
                  - if:
                      - condition: template
                        value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                    then:
                      - domain: mobile_app
                        type: notify
                        device_id: !input notify_device
                        title: "Offgrid"
                        message: "All-in stroomprijs negatief, offgrid modus ingeschakeld · Prijs EUR{{ current_price | float(0) | round(3) }}"
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ conf_backflow != [] and states(conf_backflow)|float(-1) != 0.0 }}"
                then:
                  - service: number.set_value
                    target: {entity_id: !input backflow_power_entity}
                    data: {value: 0.0}

          - conditions:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (current_price | float(0.0)) >= 0.0 }}"
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ (current_raw_price | float(0.0)) < 0.0 }}"
            sequence:
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ conf_offgrid != [] and is_state(conf_offgrid, 'on') }}"
                then:
                  - service: switch.turn_off
                    target: {entity_id: !input offgrid_switch}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ conf_backflow != [] and states(conf_backflow)|float(-1) != 0.0 }}"
                then:
                  - service: number.set_value
                    target: {entity_id: !input backflow_power_entity}
                    data: {value: 0.0}
                  - if:
                      - condition: template
                        value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                    then:
                      - domain: mobile_app
                        type: notify
                        device_id: !input notify_device
                        title: "Export geblokkeerd"
                        message: "Kale stroomprijs negatief, backflow op 0W en offgrid uit · Kale prijs EUR{{ current_raw_price | float(0) | round(3) }}"

        default:
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_offgrid != [] and is_state(conf_offgrid, 'on') }}"
            then:
              - service: switch.turn_off
                target: {entity_id: !input offgrid_switch}
          - if:
              - condition: template
                value_template: "{{ conf_backflow != [] and states(conf_backflow)|float(-1) != (p_normal_backflow|float(0)) }}"
            then:
              - service: number.set_value
                target: {entity_id: !input backflow_power_entity}
                data: {value: "{{ p_normal_backflow | float(0) }}"}
              - if:
                  - condition: template
                    value_template: "{{ notify_strategy_enabled }}"
                then:
                  - domain: mobile_app
                    type: notify
                    device_id: !input notify_device
                    title: "Export vrij"
                    message: "Stroomprijzen weer positief, export vrijgegeven · Backflow {{ p_normal_backflow }}W"

mode: single
